lf from trying to bring  Mikkel back from the hospital after that  he visits tan house to talk about time  and he gives him the broken time machine  to get it fixed he returns later to  collect it with ten house telling him  that it's the same device in a different  condition he says it's like seeing the  beginning and the end of something at  the same time he then has the  conversation with his younger self in  the bunker before going to the caves to  attempt to destroy the portal he then  travels to 2020 and returns to his  childhood home where he interrupts a  possible suicide attempt by his mother  though he doesn't see her with a gun  pointed at her throat he explains who he  is and he proves it to her by showing  scar on his arm that he got as a child  and talking about a burn mark on the  floor by the stove  he takes his mother back to 1987 so she  can see Mikkel living with her future  mother-in-law when they return they fill  Charlotte in on what's going on and  later bring Katarina in as well at one  point he sneaks into Marta's room and  places the st. Christopher medallion on  her pillow after that his mother steals  the time machine from his room while  he's asleep and she travels in search of  Ulrich stranger yonus is reunited with  martha briefly when she comes to the  house he tells her who he is and they  talk but they get interrupted when  Katarina arrives later he'll force her  into the bunker at gunpoint trying to  save her from her fate but she winds up  escaping when Peter and Elizabeth  arrived back at the house younger Noah  arrives and gives him a letter  he says was written by Marta we don't  see what it says but after he reads it  he leaves with a time machine that  Katharina had left there earlier when  she learned that the portal in the caves  had reopened he goes and he finds Magnus  bartosh and Francisca at the Nielsen's  house and travels with them narrowly  escaping the apocalypse we don't see  where they go  but can guess they eventually wind up in  1921 which is where we meet atom and we  see a confirmed older Magnus there as  well most of what we see in atoms  timeline takes place inside the church  we know that he had younger noah kill  who i presume is an older bartosh and  that he and older noah are trying to  find the missing pages from the  triquetra notebook  he has older noah kill older claudia and  retrieved those pages and that leads to  Noah learning that Charlotte is his  daughter that he's been searching for  anna meets with his younger self Jonas  telling him who he is  and somewhat vaguely what he's trying to  do he says they're waging a war against  time and he recruits his younger self to  travel back to 2019 telling him he can  fix everything if he stops his father  from committing suicide of course he is  actually sending him to set things in  motion for the suicide to happen but he  chooses not to tell him the truth  because Noah has realized Adam knew  about Charlotte the whole time and kept  that from him  he tries to kill Adam but it doesn't  work out when he fails adam has Noah's  own sister Agnes kill him instead  then Adam travels through the god  particle machine at the church to the  day of the apocalypse June 27th 2020  this is where he kills Martha in front  of his younger self saying that Jonas  has to experience that pain in order to  become him he walks out of the house and  that is the last time we see him I  assume he returns to the church and  travels back to 1921 but we'll have to  wait until season 3 comes out to know  for sure and that wraps up yonas con  Wald's journey through time in dark  seasons 1 &amp; 2 I expect that we'll be  getting an announcement about season 3  and a trailer any time now and I  couldn't be more excited I'm gonna end  this video here but I will be back with  more dark videos while we wait for  season 3 to come out please like this  video if you enjoyed it please subscribe  to my  if you're a fan of the show if you have  any questions about seasons one or two  leave them in the comments let me know  your theories about what's going to  happen in season three and thanks for  watching I will talk to you soon
 

